---
description: Authentication and authorization rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Authentication lives in `src/lib/auth`. Do not parse session cookies in feature code.
- Pages that require an account call `requireUser()` or `requireAnonymous()`.
- Route Handlers that require an account call `requireAuth()`. Role checks call `requireRole()`.
- Hiding a button is not authorization. Every protected Route Handler checks the session on the server.
- Registration must not accept a role. New accounts receive `user`.
- Do not add a second auth library or a custom JWT session.
- Do not log passwords, tokens, cookies, or raw authorization headers.
